            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon, onu çağıran koda bir değer döndürebilir. Bu uygulama, görevini gerçekleştirmeye yardımcı olmak için onu çağıran koda bir değer döndürür.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #D5F5E3&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #85C1E9;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    color: #7c795d;&#xA;    font-family: 'Trocchi', serif;&#xA;    font-size: 45px;&#xA;    font-weight: normal;&#xA;    line-height: 48px;&#xA;    margin: 0;&#xA;    text-align: centre&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Pound Converter&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Add value in pounds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;label&gt;Pounds&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;   &lt;input id=&quot;inputPounds&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; placeholder=&quot;Pounds&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onClick=&quot;convert()&quot;&gt;convert&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Kilograms: &lt;span id=&quot;outputKilograms&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function convert() {&#xA;    let pounds = document.getElementById(&quot;inputPounds&quot;).value;&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;outputKilograms&quot;).innerHTML = pounds /&#xA;     2.2046;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 127121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyondan bir şey döndürmek için önce <code>-&gt;</code> söz dizimini ve ardından tür adını kullanarak dönüş türünü belirtiriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>String</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 127636,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyondan bir şey döndürmek için, burada <code>return age</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesini ve ardından döndürülecek değeri ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: \\(number)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>age</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Any type",
            "id": 127122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon string, int veya boolean gibi her türden değer döndürebilir. Bu fonksiyon, <code>result</code> içindeki sayı değerini döndürür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"timesTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = number * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>result</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 127123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca tek bir değer döndürebiliriz. Burada <code>return isGreater;</code> ile değişkenin içindeki boolean değeri döndürüyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greaterThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Bool\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater = number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>isGreater</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Using the return value",
            "id": 127124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonu çağırarak dönüş değerini diğer tüm değerler gibi kullanabiliriz. Burada, değerini kullanmak için <code>userAge(number: 22)</code> fonksiyonunu çağırıyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: \\(number)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(userAge(number: \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>userAge</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>number:</code>, <code>22</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Storing it in a variable",
            "id": 127125,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döndürülen değeri bir değişkende de saklayabiliriz. Burada döndürülen değeri <code>result</code> içinde saklıyor ve konsolda görüntülüyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: \\(number)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = userAge(number: \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 29\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>result</code>, ardından <code>print</code> ve son olarak <code>result</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
